{% comment %}
  SS Sale — hide a section in one of the sale page's two modes (#144).
  sections/ss-sale-hero.liquid works out the mode from its schedule and puts
  ss-sale--on or ss-sale--off on <html>. This snippet hides the calling section
  in the other mode, so "Sale" sections disappear off-season and "Off-season"
  sections disappear during the sale. With no class on <html> (no sale hero on
  the page, e.g. every anchor page) nothing is hidden.
  Usage:
    {%- render 'ss-sale-visibility', id: section.id, show: section.settings.sale_visibility -%}
  Params:
    - id   (required) section.id
    - show 'always' (default) | 'sale' | 'off'
{% endcomment %}
{%- if id != blank and show == 'sale' -%}
  {%- style -%}
    html.ss-sale--off #shopify-section-{{ id }} { display: none; }
  {%- endstyle -%}
{%- elsif id != blank and show == 'off' -%}
  {%- style -%}
    html.ss-sale--on #shopify-section-{{ id }} { display: none; }
  {%- endstyle -%}
{%- endif -%}
